hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17654","Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us: Shu'bah narrated to us, from Anas ibn Sirin, from 'Abd al-Malik ibn al-Minhal, from his father, who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) commanded us to observe the white days, and it is the fast of the month."
"17655","'Abd al-Samad narrated to us: Hammam narrated to us: Anas ibn Sirin narrated to us, from 'Abd al-Malik ibn Qatadah ibn Milhan al-'Absi, from his father, who said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) used to command fasting, and he mentioned it."
